        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long has Café Athena been open in Pacific Beach?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Café Athena has been open since 1990. It is a Greek and Mediterranean restaurant and bar at 1846 Garnet Ave in Pacific Beach, San Diego, CA 92109. Café Athena is family-owned and operated. It began in 1990 as a 20-seat taverna run by founder Tony Farah. In 2005 the family opened Apollonia in La Jolla, which closed in 2020 after 15 years because of new development plans. In 2019 Tony, working with his son Joe, transformed Café Athena by adding a full bar and expanding the Mediterranean concept. Joe now carries the family's hospitality tradition forward."
          }
        },
